{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\"feel\":\"前一段的游移在这里终于有了落脚处：人不再带着迫切的索求往里追，反而出现一种较安静、克制而真实的亲近和满足；但这份安稳并不等于圆满，尚未安顿的部分仍在，所以舒展之中还留着一点牵挂。\",\"thread\":\"上一段已经显出，继续加深原有的满足并不能直接处理剩下的需要，因此此刻不再能够像先前那样把“不够”立刻变成“还要更多”。也正因为原有的满足暂时不必承担解决全部需要的任务，它反而可以更单纯地被接受：已经得到的仍然是真的，也仍然值得亲近。这使人从先前的迫切和无着中安静下来；但没有了不断索求的推动，尚未满足的部分也没有因此消失，于是安稳和牵挂可以同时存在。\",\"used\":\"第2段已经确认这里确实能给出真实的满足；第3段已经分清真实满足与需要被完全安顿不是一回事；第4段曾试图通过加深已有满足来回应剩余需要；第5段已经发现这条“再多一些”的路有其限度。\",\"new\":[\"已有的满足第一次可以不以“是否解决全部需要”来衡量：即使它有限，也仍然能够单独成立并被接受。\",\"当人不再立刻用更深的索求去处理不足时，满足与尚未安顿的需要可以较清楚地同时存在，而不必互相否定。\"],\"unexplained\":\"这条理解能说明这里为何比前一段更安稳、又没有变成彻底满足，但对其中那种略带陌生、仿佛与先前的投入保持了一点距离的感觉，还只能部分解释。\"}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a6058bb3-7608-4843-8421-bcb1fef3dccf", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T220142307736Z", "elapsed_seconds": 26.625, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T22:02:08.951769+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "756c17140a8190487538977faac70e51eb451be164cac378bee86c8eecc4ca5f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T220142307736Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "46bb095a6bf4b02b320ffb9836e73d00ced3efb94c3e36f6dcff2022719a909a"}}}
